+# Plan: RadioList outline style
+
+## Task 1 — `IsOutline` parameter on RadioList / RadioListGeneric  ✅ complete
+- Acceptance: `IsButton && IsOutline` renders `btn btn-outline-{Color}` on every item, `active` on the selected item (no `bg-{Color}`), and `is-outline` on the group. Default rendering unchanged.
+- Files: `RadioList.razor.cs`, `RadioListGeneric.razor.cs`, `RadioList.razor.scss`, `RadioTest.cs`, `RadioListGenericTest.cs`
+- Verify: `dotnet test test/UnitTest --filter "FullyQualifiedName~Radio"`
+
+## Task 2 — Demo and docs  ✅ complete
+- Depends on: Task 1
+- Acceptance: outline example in the Button Radio demo, `IsOutline` row in the attribute table, en-US/zh-CN strings.
+- Files: `Radios.razor`, `Radios.razor.cs`, `Locales/en-US.json`, `Locales/zh-CN.json`
+- Verify: `dotnet build src/BootstrapBlazor.Server`
